  "label": "Islamophobia",
  "description": "The meme promotes hostility toward Muslims by calling for 'all races' to unite against 'islam'. This implicitly references the real-world stereotype that Muslims are inherently violent or incompatible with Western values, which is a core component of Islamophobia. The phrase 'against islam!' frames the entire religious group as a monolithic enemy, ignoring diversity within Islam and promoting fear and division.",
